# LOCAL-ONLY SECURITY WORKSPACE — unfixed findings + their working proofs of concept.
# These describe exploitable paths against contracts that are LIVE on mainnet; publishing them in a public
# repo before the fix ships hands an attacker the PoC. Same reason learnings/records/HANDOFF stay local.
# Un-ignore a file only in the same change that fixes what it proves.
